package dev.creapolis.pepinillo.ui.theme

import androidx.compose.ui.graphics.Color

// =============================================================================
// Sprint 8 (#494) — Material 3 Expressive-style palettes.
//
// Each of the four themes (base Pepinillo Green + Forest + Ocean + Sunset) owns a full tonal
// scheme in light and dark. Values were generated by `PaletteGenerator` (test-scope) using the
// project's HSL utilities and tuned to clear WCAG AA contrast on every container/onContainer pair.
//
// Seeds:
//   base   #4CAF50   (Pepinillo Green)
//   forest #2E7D32
//   ocean  #0077B6
//   sunset #E64A19
//
// The base scheme is exposed under two name families for backwards compatibility:
//   - `md_theme_light_*` / `md_theme_dark_*` (the original names Theme.kt still imports)
//   - `md_theme_base_light_*` / `md_theme_base_dark_*` (explicit, parallels the other themes)
// Both name families point at the same values.
// =============================================================================

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// BASE — seed #4CAF50 (Pepinillo Green)
